  "title": "Arizer Air SE Portable Vaporizer (taxes extra)",
  "description": "The Arizer Air SE\n\n3 COLORS TO CHOOSE FROM:\nBLUE HAZES, REEFER WHITE, TIME WARP GREEN\n\nIntroducing the perfect Dry Herb Vaporizer for beginners and budget-conscious consumers. Everything Arizer is known for in a slimmed down economical package: Quality & Performance, Smooth & Tasty Vapor. Advanced rapid heating ceramic technology, 5 preset temperatures, micro-USB charging, plus a convenient Use While Charging feature. Available in Reefer White and translucent Blue Haze.\n\nCustom Session Settings\nThe Air SE has a simple operating system with a large adjustment button and easy to read LED icons. Choose from 5 preset temperatures to extract tasty vapor just the way you like it. The auto shut off feature is perfectly timed for full extraction and also saves your battery life.\n\nThe Original Glass Pod System\nOur resilient borosilicate glass aroma tube is easy to use & easy to clean. The gentle heat transfer of the glass allows the herb to heat up without releasing flavors or active components. When you inhale, fresh air is heated by the high quality ceramic heating element for a flavorful & potent vapor.\n\nNever Miss a Beat\nAll the power you need with up to 80 minutes of use per charge, fast Micro USB charging and our session saving Use While Charging feature. Slide down the rear cover for easy access to the rechargeable & interchangeable 18650 lithium ion battery. The convenient Battery Level Indicator lets you know your power status at every start up.\n\nBONUS ITEMS: 4 SCREENS, 2 STICKS, 1 BRUSH\n\nFeatures:\nFor Dry Herbs & Aromatherapy\nEasy to Use & Easy to Clean\nAdvanced Rapid-Heating Ceramic Technology\n5 Preset Temperatures\nUp to 80 minutes of use per charge\nHigh Capacity, Rechargeable, interchangeable Batteries\nMicro USB Charging\nUse While Charging for non-stop action\nPre-load doses & PVC Travel Tubes\nIsolated Air and All-Glass Vapor Path\nHigh Quality Parts & Accessories\n\nWARRANTY\n\nSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSaveSave",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>The Arizer Air SE</p>\n<p>3 COLORS TO CHOOSE FROM:<br />BLUE HAZES, REEFER WHITE, TIME WARP GREEN<br /></strong>  <br />Introducing the perfect Dry Herb Vaporizer for beginners and budget-conscious consumers. Everything Arizer is known for in a slimmed down economical package: Quality &amp; Performance, Smooth &amp; Tasty Vapor. Advanced rapid heating ceramic technology, 5 preset temperatures, micro-USB charging, plus a convenient Use While Charging feature. Available in Reefer White and translucent Blue Haze.</p>\n<p><strong>Custom Session Settings</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">The Air SE has a simple operating system with a large adjustment button and easy to read LED icons. Choose from 5 preset temperatures to extract tasty vapor just the way you like it. The auto shut off feature is perfectly timed for full extraction and also saves your battery life.</p>\n<p><strong>The Original Glass Pod System</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Our resilient borosilicate glass aroma tube is easy to use &amp; easy to clean. The gentle heat transfer of the glass allows the herb to heat up without releasing flavors or active components. When you inhale, fresh air is heated by the high quality ceramic heating element for a flavorful &amp; potent vapor.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br /><strong>Never Miss a Beat</strong><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">All the power you need with up to 80 minutes of use per charge, fast Micro USB charging and our session saving Use While Charging feature. Slide down the rear cover for easy access to the rechargeable &amp; interchangeable 18650 lithium ion battery. The convenient Battery Level Indicator lets you know your power status at every start up.<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br /><strong>BONUS ITEMS: 4 SCREENS, 2 STICKS, 1 BRUSH</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Features:</strong><br />For Dry Herbs &amp; Aromatherapy<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Easy to Use &amp; Easy to Clean<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Advanced Rapid-Heating Ceramic Technology<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">5 Preset Temperatures<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Up to 80 minutes of use per charge<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">High Capacity, Rechargeable, interchangeable Batteries<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Micro USB Charging<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Use While Charging for non-stop action<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Pre-load doses &amp; PVC Travel Tubes<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">Isolated Air and All-Glass Vapor Path<br data-mce-fragment=\"1\">High Quality Parts &amp; Accessories</p>\n<p></p>\n<h5>WARRANTY<br /> </h5>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><a href=\"https://vaporizers.ca/pages/arizer-warranty-information\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0266/5065/files/warranty_6743b620-f6e8-485f-a92d-8f39f2385313_medium.jpg?v=1475077314\" alt=\"Warranty Information\" style=\"float: left\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"> </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer;top: 681px;left: 466px\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=\"border-radius: 2px;text-indent: 20px;width: auto;padding: 0px 4px 0px 0px;text-align: center;font: bold 11px/20px &apos;Helvetica Neue&apos;,Helvetica,sans-serif;color: #ffffff;background: #bd081c  no-repeat scroll 3px 50% / 14px 14px;position: absolute;opacity: 1;z-index: 8675309;display: none;cursor: pointer\">Save</span><span style=\"